  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e06-scene-15",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "君にもぜひ見てもらいたい自信作だ  (A Work I'm Proud to Show You)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "driver": "配達員",
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the wrap party on the island, Muranishi's crew raises a glass and thanks their coordinator for saving the shoot. Then the hotel phone rings—it's Kuroki calling from Tokyo. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "乾杯！いい作品が撮れたね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "これね、一発逆転ホームランになるかも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ジミーがいてくれて助かったよ。ありがとう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "僕は自分の仕事をしただけだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もしもし。どうした、黒木君？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ごめんなさい、いきなりお電話して。川田さんから連絡先を聞いたんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "撮影はうまくいきましたか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、うまくいった。君にもぜひ見てもらいたい自信作だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "楽しみです。実はお伝えしたいことがあって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "ボス、彼女が帰るそうで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうか。またすぐかけ直す。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "じゃあ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "乾杯！いい作品が撮れたね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cheers! We shot a great film, didn't we?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "これね、一発逆転ホームランになるかも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This might really turn into that comeback home run.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ジミーがいてくれて助かったよ。ありがとう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Having you here really saved us. Thank you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "僕は自分の仕事をしただけだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was only doing my job.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もしもし。どうした、黒木君？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello? What's the matter, Kuroki?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ごめんなさい、いきなりお電話して。川田さんから連絡先を聞いたんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm sorry for calling so suddenly. I got your contact number from Mr. Kawada.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "撮影はうまくいきましたか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did the filming go well?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、うまくいった。君にもぜひ見てもらいたい自信作だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, it went great. It's a work I'm proud of and really want you to see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "楽しみです。実はお伝えしたいことがあって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm looking forward to it. Actually, there's something I wanted to tell you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "ボス、彼女が帰るそうで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, she says she's heading home now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうか。またすぐかけ直す。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I see. I'll call you right back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "じゃあ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bye for now.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
